{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#card-zh","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 是面向 DSH 网页端的会话大纲插件，在会话标题栏加入操作按钮，并显示可拖动的浮动面板。它从当前会话快照提取用户提问作为根节点，将助手回复中的 Markdown 标题按层级列在提问下方，同时展示提问时间、工具数和正文长度。用户可以调整显示层级、搜索问题或标题、收藏条目、跳转到正文位置，并将大纲复制或导出为 Markdown；面板还支持宽度切换、键盘导航和阅读位置记忆。适合需要在长对话中快速定位问题与章节的 DSH 网页用户。需要 DSH Web 客户端和宿主提供的 React，不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1772-1817","client.js:3929-3975","client.js:3420-3438"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#card-en","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-conversation adds a searchable outline panel to DSH web sessions. It groups user questions with headings from assistant replies, letting users search, bookmark, jump to messages, and copy or export a Markdown outline. It requires the host React runtime; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1772-1817","client.js:3929-3975","client.js:3420-3438"]}
