{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#feature-1","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 的功能「会话问题与标题大纲」：将用户提问列为根节点，并把助手回复中的 Markdown 标题按层级归到对应提问下。打开会话标题栏的大纲面板即可浏览，并可点击条目跳到正文位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1241-1265","client.js:1772-1817","client.js:3929-3975"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#feature-2","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 的功能「搜索与筛选」：按关键词查找大纲内容，并可切换为只匹配用户提问或只匹配标题。使用面板中的搜索框输入关键词，再选择搜索范围缩小结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1616-1640","client.js:1112-1117"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#feature-3","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 的功能「复制与导出」：把当前会话大纲整理为 Markdown 文本，可复制到剪贴板，也可下载为 .md 文件。通过面板工具栏的复制或导出按钮触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2248-2265","client.js:3420-3438"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#feature-4","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 的功能「收藏与阅读位置」：可以收藏大纲节点并筛选只看收藏项；每个会话还会记住上次查看的大纲位置，切回会话时恢复浏览位置。收藏和阅读状态通过面板操作并按会话保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1473-1550","client.js:2230-2246","client.js:3172-3188"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#caveat-1","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存面板偏好、收藏和阅读位置；这些状态保存在当前浏览器配置中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2164-2178","client.js:2230-2246"]}
{"unit_id":"huangfuren__dsh-conversation#caveat-2","repo":"huangfuren/dsh-conversation","commit":"97bd48c57506f0abfdfe4fb1088cd1982e927b0c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-conversation 的界面只面向 DSH Web 客户端，并依赖宿主提供的 React；其他客户端没有在配置中声明支持。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:32-40","client.js:29-34"]}
